      "Language": "ita",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In this paper a new computer aided ECG and VCG data handling is analized. It is based on an optimum estimation of dipole moment, which is used as the main diagnosis parameter. Already known diagnostical methods (available in present literature) are compared with this new technique. The available diagnostical range has been increased widely. The sensitivity of such a program is being analyzed both for normal and abnormal cases."},
